<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>準備中</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      font-family: "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN", "Hiragino Sans", Meiryo, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      color: #333;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .container {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 480px;
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="icon">🚧</div>
    <h1>サイト準備中</h1>
    <p>
      現在、サイトの設定を行っています。<br>
      しばらくお待ちください。
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
